    // variant's paragraphs survive and others are deleted), each
    // `&[Variant]` marker now just UPDATES the current variant for
    // subsequent `#[…]` clause lookups. Nothing gets deleted. IF/ELSE
    // structure stays intact and is processed normally by Step 1.
    //
    // This means a skeleton can look like:
    //   {{IF: type == Mutual}}
    //   &[Mutual NDA]
    //   1. Objective. #[Objective]    ← resolves to (Objective, Mutual NDA)
    //   {{ELSE}}
